#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:5 9ac2a22d830c488f8a53575e9ab31a41
msgid "Arming / Disarming"
msgstr "解锁 / 上锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:7 0deee2becb1243c39df674f317e90188
msgid ""
"Before the rover's motors will move it must be armed.  Arming is required "
"for two reasons:"
msgstr "在车辆电机运转之前，必须先进行解锁。解锁有两个原因："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:9 34bef23c221a4b53b1b826b832ad1745
msgid "to prevent the motors from turning when the user is not ready to drive"
msgstr "防止用户尚未准备好驾驶时电机意外转动"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:10 a2eb320684cb4d348c73b8d822349871
msgid ""
"prevent movement before the autopilot is fully configured and ready to go"
msgstr "在飞控完全配置并就绪之前防止车辆移动"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:13 776529719bf34f62b1cdc03bbaa93f65
msgid "How to Arm"
msgstr "如何解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:15 68ece3bae6914396955a91deea2fdd59
msgid ""
"Before arming you should normally wait for the LED on the autopilot to "
"become flashing blue (if you only intend to use :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>`)"
" or flashing green (for all other modes). If the LEDs never become blue or "
"green please see the \"Pre-Arm Checks\" section below."
msgstr ""
"解锁前，通常应等待飞控上的 LED 变为蓝色闪烁（若仅使用 :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>` "
"模式）或绿色闪烁（适用于其他所有模式）。若 LED 始终未变为蓝色或绿色，请参阅下方「解锁前检查」章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:19 5a781053df6f4f9aaf9c1afae73069fe
msgid "There are three ways to arm the vehicle:"
msgstr "有三种方式可以解锁车辆："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:21 cb7b6aca01044c0ba008320d7d0d8224
msgid ""
"**From the transmitter sticks**.  Ensure the vehicle is in :ref:`Hold <hold-"
"mode>`, :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>`, :ref:`Acro <acro-mode>` or "
":ref:`Steering <steering-mode>` mode, then center the throttle stick and "
"hold the steering stick fully to the right for 2 seconds"
msgstr ""
"**通过遥控器摇杆**。确保车辆处于 :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>`、:ref:`Manual <manual-"
"mode>`、:ref:`Acro <acro-mode>` 或 :ref:`Steering <steering-mode>` "
"模式，将油门摇杆置于中位，然后将转向摇杆向右完全推到底并保持 2 秒"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:22 74e67cc26afd44f8b1e4c3c17cee07fd
msgid ""
"**From a transmitter switch**.  If setup, you can use one of the "
"**RCx_OPTION switches** that includes the arm function. See switch option "
"\"153\", \"154, or \"160."
msgstr ""
"**通过遥控器开关**。若已配置，可使用包含解锁功能的 **RCx_OPTION 开关**。参见开关选项 「153」、「154」或「160」。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:23
#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:36 5fe38e9eaf2d41c191b22d5203e5f636
#: 64a6d298aeb44b8ca40b220b26c4025a
msgid ""
"**From the Ground Station**.  Press the arm/disarm button on your ground "
"station.  If using the Mission Planner this can be found on the Flight Data "
"screen's action tab on the bottom left"
msgstr "**通过地面站**。在地面站上按下解锁/上锁按钮。若使用 Mission Planner，该按钮位于飞行数据界面左下方的操作选项卡中"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:27 f9b2bf3686a24de2af0440761a77cd39
msgid ""
"If the vehicle fails to arm, please see the \"Pre-Arm Checks\" section "
"below."
msgstr "若车辆无法解锁，请参阅下方「解锁前检查」章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:29 c82cd913b3634b8191eee10db3480159
msgid ""
"Rover cannot be armed in RTL or SMARTRTL modes. In addition AUTO, GUIDED, "
"LOITER, RTL, SMARTRTL, FOLLOW, and DOCK modes cannot be armed via an "
":ref:`common-auxiliary-functions` RC switch."
msgstr ""
"Rover 不能在 RTL 或 SmartRTL 模式下解锁。此外，AUTO、Guided、Loiter、RTL、SmartRTL、FOLLOW 和 "
"DOCK 模式不能通过 :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions` RC 开关解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:32 2d88260d6d4e48efb091770f8b625cc7
msgid "How to Disarm"
msgstr "如何上锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:34 c27bba7951a24d0b949495a1741a321b
msgid ""
"**From the transmitter sticks**.  Ensure the vehicle is in :ref:`Hold <hold-"
"mode>`, :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>`, :ref:`Acro <acro-mode>` or "
":ref:`Steering <steering-mode>` mode, then hold the steering stick fully "
"left for 2 seconds"
msgstr ""
"**通过遥控器摇杆**。确保车辆处于 :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>`、:ref:`Manual <manual-"
"mode>`、:ref:`Acro <acro-mode>` 或 :ref:`Steering <steering-mode>` "
"模式，然后将转向摇杆向左完全推到底并保持 2 秒"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:35 2dd1a012381f4fd3a08f5c37062b73f5
msgid ""
"**From a transmitter switch**.  If setup, you can use one of the "
"``RCx_OPTION`` switches that includes the disarm function. See switch option"
" \"81\", \"153, or \"154\"."
msgstr "**通过遥控器开关**。若已配置，可使用包含上锁功能的 ``RCx_OPTION`` 开关。参见开关选项「81」、「153」或「154」。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:40 990e1a98245d42929d2cc842248e6087
msgid ""
"Skid-steering vehicles can only be disarmed from the transmitter in "
":ref:`Hold <hold-mode>` mode because otherwise they would turn around and "
"around in circles whilst the pilot was trying to disarm"
msgstr ""
"差速转向车辆只能在遥控器处于 :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>` 模式时通过遥控器上锁，否则在操作者尝试上锁时车辆会不停地原地打转"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:44 a47e01ae398d43deb0c052af9ab79e8a
msgid "Pre-Arm Checks"
msgstr "解锁前检查"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:46 426c636bc82b4acc809e664f445d5c64
msgid ""
"Rover includes a suite of safety checks which prevent the vehicle from "
"arming if any of a fairly large number of issues are discovered including "
"missed calibration, configuration or bad sensor data.  These checks help "
"prevent sudden motor startups and drive-aways but they can also be disabled "
"by setting the :ref:`ARMING_CHECK <ARMING_CHECK>` parameter if necessary."
msgstr ""
"Rover "
"包含一套安全检查机制，若发现相当多的问题（包括未完成校准、配置错误或传感器数据异常），将阻止车辆解锁。这些检查有助于防止电机突然启动和车辆失控驶离，但如有必要，也可通过设置"
" :ref:`ARMING_CHECK <ARMING_CHECK>` 参数来禁用这些检查。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:52 eaad22178c3240a9b0ae8db1d5683049
msgid ""
"The reason for the failure can be seen by connecting the autopilot to a "
"ground station (using telemetry or a USB cable), after attempting to arm the"
" reason should be displayed on the HUD in red letters."
msgstr "可通过将飞控连接到地面站（使用数传或 USB 线缆）查看失败原因，尝试解锁后失败原因应以红色文字显示在 HUD 上。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:56 9fb019027b55458d9c5aa5980922c908
msgid ""
"A more complete list of failures can be found on the :ref:`Pre-Arm Safety "
"Checks<common-prearm-safety-checks>` but some common of the Rover specific "
"checks are listed below:"
msgstr ""
"更完整的失败列表可在 :ref:`解锁前安全检查 <common-prearm-safety-checks>` 中找到，以下列出了一些 Rover "
"特有的常见检查项目："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:58 d54a124ca71d4c45be5c3a8ca6c4f8da
msgid ""
"Safety switch. The safety switch must be set to the off state before arming "
"is allowed. This is either done by pressing the safety switch for 2 seconds "
"until it stops flashing, or you can disable the use of the safety switch by "
"setting :ref:`BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT <BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT>` to 0."
msgstr ""
"安全开关。解锁前必须将安全开关置于关闭状态。可按住安全开关 2 秒直至其停止闪烁，或将 :ref:`BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT "
"<BRD_SAFETY_DEFLT>` 设置为 0 来禁用安全开关。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:62 477927e837d04d53a2d9c8191503f02a
msgid ""
"Inertial Sensor Checks. The accelerometers and gyroscopes must all be "
"healthy and all be calibrated. If you have more than one accel or gyro then "
"they need to be consistent with each other."
msgstr "惯性传感器检查。所有加速度计和陀螺仪必须正常工作且完成校准。若存在多个加速度计或陀螺仪，它们之间的数据需相互一致。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:65 9bbde964e7ed4aff87abfbbd0b5184a5
msgid ""
"AHRS checks. The AHRS (attitude heading reference system) needs to be "
"initialized and ready. This normally takes at least 30 seconds after boot."
msgstr "AHRS 检查。AHRS（姿态航向参考系统）需要完成初始化并就绪。这通常在启动后至少需要 30 秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:67 3ab6dfc109754530810b46cc523b424a
msgid ""
"Compass checks. All compasses must be configured and calibrated, and need to"
" be consistent with each other (if you have more than one compass)"
msgstr "罗盘检查。所有罗盘必须已配置并完成校准，且数据之间需相互一致（若存在多个罗盘）"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:69 42e93116d488478082c8c72b0b8151e1
msgid ""
"GPS Checks. You need to have a 3D GPS fix for most modes. **GPS n has not "
"been fully configured** is displayed when the GPS driver is unable to fully "
"configure the GPS. This can be caused by a bad wire between the autopilot "
"and GPS, or by a bad response from the GPS."
msgstr ""
"GPS 检查。大多数模式需要获得 3D GPS 定位。当 GPS 驱动无法完全配置 GPS 时，将显示 **GPS n "
"尚未完全配置**。这可能是由飞控与 GPS 之间的线路不良或 GPS 响应异常引起的。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:73 9451250af68249269ae58d6755db2838
msgid ""
"Battery checks. The battery voltage must be above the failsafe voltage (if "
"configured)"
msgstr "电池检查。电池电压必须高于失控保护电压（若已配置）"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:75 ddff945988724009a5318af554032ecb
msgid ""
"Logging checks. The logging subsystem needs to be working (ie. a microSD "
"must be fitted and working)"
msgstr "日志检查。日志子系统必须正常运行（即必须安装并正常工作的 microSD 卡）"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:77 ba42e25a8597407ba6bde6576b2d6faa
msgid ""
"RC Control checks. The RC input must have be calibrated and not in failsafe "
"(i.e. transmitter switched on)."
msgstr "遥控器控制检查。RC 输入必须已完成校准且不处于失控保护状态（即发射机已开启）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:79 2bcf258930024e1c9b7004abcce7d4a6
msgid ""
"The pre-arm checks can be partially or completely disabled by setting the "
":ref:`ARMING_CHECK <ARMING_CHECK>` parameter.  The default of 1 means all "
"checks are enabled.  If set to 0 all checks are disabled.  Ground Stations "
"including the mission planner also allow disabling individual checks."
msgstr ""
"可通过设置 :ref:`ARMING_CHECK <ARMING_CHECK>` 参数来部分或完全禁用解锁前检查。默认值 1 表示启用所有检查；若设置为"
" 0，则禁用所有检查。包括 Mission Planner 在内的地面站也允许单独禁用某些检查项目。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:84 776bcbee9ece412e8eb4963c3b0baf15
msgid ""
"In general the cause of a failure should be addressed and the "
":ref:`ARMING_CHECK <ARMING_CHECK>` parameter should be reset back to 1."
msgstr "通常应查明并解决故障原因，并将 :ref:`ARMING_CHECK <ARMING_CHECK>` 参数重置回 1。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:88 256c00a9389c46a48b6528f1953649b6
msgid ""
"If you are arming from the transmitter and no failure message is being "
"displayed on the HUD then it may be that the RC calibration is off so the "
"autopilot is not seeing the throttle at middle or steering at the full right"
" position.  Try re-doing the :ref:`RC calibration <common-radio-control-"
"calibration>`."
msgstr ""
"若通过遥控器解锁但 HUD 上未显示任何失败消息，则可能是 RC 校准有误，导致飞控无法检测到油门位于中位或转向摇杆在最右侧。请尝试重新执行 "
":ref:`RC 校准 <common-radio-control-calibration>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:93 599c78026df94e6da5692d9e99062224
msgid "Disabling Arming/Disarming"
msgstr "禁用解锁/上锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:95 f7e7835c28594cecb9452ce42614648f
msgid ""
"Although it is not recommended, it is possible to disable the requirement to"
" arm the vehicle by setting the :ref:`ARMING_REQUIRE <ARMING_REQUIRE>` "
"parameter to zero. The vehicle will effectively be armed immediately at "
"startup but please note that modes requiring GPS (all modes except "
":ref:`Hold <hold-mode>` and :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>`) will not operate "
"until after a good GPS lock (or more accurately a good EKF position "
"estimate) is achieved."
msgstr ""
"虽然不推荐，但可以通过将 :ref:`ARMING_REQUIRE <ARMING_REQUIRE>` "
"参数设置为零来禁用解锁要求。车辆将在启动后立即进入有效的解锁状态，但请注意，需要 GPS 的模式（除 :ref:`Hold <hold-mode>` 和"
" :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>` 之外的所有模式）在获得良好 GPS 锁定（或更准确地说是良好的 EKF "
"位置估计）之前将无法运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:102
#: 64661a495a48413a94a66db348e02177
msgid "LED and Buzzer"
msgstr "LED 与蜂鸣器"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:104
#: 35c1d9e096fd4e89ac70c2b7b9692410
msgid ""
"The LED and buzzer provide visual and audio clues as to the arming state:"
msgstr "LED 和蜂鸣器提供解锁状态的视觉与听觉提示："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:106
#: 5c6b839cb19142e7a09c17bf00c4c48f
msgid ""
"LED flashing blue - vehicle is disarmed but is ready-to-arm in :ref:`Manual "
"<manual-mode>`"
msgstr "LED 蓝色闪烁——车辆已上锁，但在 :ref:`Manual <manual-mode>` 模式下已准备好解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:107
#: 522882012a4f4af397b942f929431aa4
msgid ""
"LED flashing green - vehicle is disarmed but ready-to-arm in all modes "
"(vehicle has a good position estimate)"
msgstr "LED 绿色闪烁——车辆已上锁，但在所有模式下均已准备好解锁（车辆具有良好的位置估计）"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:108
#: 3df99ee72645442fab61632fda506bc7
msgid ""
"LED flashing yellow - vehicle cannot be armed because one of the pre-arm "
"checks is failing"
msgstr "LED 黄色闪烁——车辆无法解锁，因为某项解锁前检查未通过"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:109
#: 47cc97e1ac804323939cfacc7e917678
msgid ""
"when the autopilot is ready to arm it will play a \"ready to arm\" sound on "
"the buzzer"
msgstr "当飞控准备好解锁时，蜂鸣器会播放「准备解锁」的声音"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:111
#: 0934516d008b4278be9c7acc61711e45
msgid "during arming the buzzer will play a 2 second long warning buzzer"
msgstr "解锁过程中蜂鸣器会发出持续 2 秒的警告声"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:112
#: c2dcbc46ab4c404aafdec84dbd923dba
msgid "during disarming, the buzzer will play a short warning buzz"
msgstr "上锁过程中蜂鸣器会发出短促的警告声"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:114
#: bb49390a68524a8697ccc2de43cdeea8
msgid ""
"A full list of buzzer sounds can be found on the :ref:`sounds page <common-"
"sounds-pixhawkpx4>`."
msgstr "完整的蜂鸣器声音列表可在 :ref:`声音页面 <common-sounds-pixhawkpx4>` 中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:116
#: 500512fd27e84193a0ce5375861554cd
msgid ""
"Unless the :ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>` bit 2 is set, text messages"
" will be sent to the GCS to indicate when arming or disarming has occurred."
msgstr ""
"除非设置了 :ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>` 的第 2 "
"位，否则在解锁或上锁时将向地面站发送文本消息以进行指示。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:119
#: 32dd818f9f3b4344bdf8a9963593c261
msgid "PWM Output Behaviour when Disarmed"
msgstr "上锁状态下的 PWM 输出行为"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:121
#: bd4383479ddf48deb55a30fc9cbf5c2d
msgid ""
"The PWM value output to the servos and motors while the vehicle is disarmed "
"can be configured in one of two ways:"
msgstr "车辆上锁时向舵机和电机输出的 PWM 值可通过以下两种方式之一进行配置："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:123
#: 59bead5266f140dd98d1993e21501668
msgid ""
"if :ref:`MOT_SAFE_DISARM <MOT_SAFE_DISARM>` is 0 (the default) the trim "
"value for each channel will be output (i.e :ref:`RC1_TRIM <RC1_TRIM>` will "
"be output on channel 1, :ref:`RC3_TRIM <RC3_TRIM>` will be output on channel"
" 3)."
msgstr ""
"若 :ref:`MOT_SAFE_DISARM <MOT_SAFE_DISARM>` 为 0（默认值），将输出每个通道的中立修调值（即通道 1 输出 "
":ref:`RC1_TRIM <RC1_TRIM>`，通道 3 输出 :ref:`RC3_TRIM <RC3_TRIM>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:125
#: 66c0156ddc42447490e7e66dd22ff241
msgid ""
"if :ref:`MOT_SAFE_DISARM <MOT_SAFE_DISARM>` is 1 no PWM pulses will be sent "
"while disarmed. Note that some ESCs beep to complain that they are powered "
"on without a control signal"
msgstr ""
"若 :ref:`MOT_SAFE_DISARM <MOT_SAFE_DISARM>` 为 1，上锁时将不发送任何 PWM "
"脉冲。注意，某些电调会在通电但没有控制信号时发出报警声"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-rover.rst:128
#: c42b42e9bce44784a2324b265500f07a
msgid ""
"Note that if the autopilot has a safety switch which is enabled, no PWM "
"output will be sent until the safety switch is put in the ON position."
msgstr "请注意，若飞控启用了安全开关，在安全开关置于 ON 位置之前不会发送任何 PWM 输出。"
